    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "cuDF only supports 128 bit types for decimal (fixed point) data. Generic 128 bit signed/unsigned integer data types are not supported. See this blog post for information about 128 bit decimals, which are internally represented by the CUDA extension type `__int128`: https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/implementing-high-precision-decimal-arithmetic-with-cuda-int128/",
    "created_at": "2023-02-07T12:20:59Z",
