  {
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "Side note: I did a little more research and I think the CUDA extended types may only include signed `__int128`. I didn\u2019t see any references to unsigned `__uint128`, so it is unlikely that cuDF could support the unsigned type without new CUDA language features.",
