  {
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "Since you don't have to do math on these hash values, you just need to store them, you have some decent options:\r\n- You could use a string column with a UTF-8 encoding of the raw binary data (or a plain string encoding of the hexadecimal or decimal integer form of the value, if you wished)\r\n- You could use two uint64s in a struct column\r\n- You could use two uint64s in a list column\r\n- You could use two separate uint64 columns and always group by both keys",
    "created_at": "2023-02-08T15:42:04Z",
    "html_url": "https://github.com/rapidsai/cudf/issues/12716#issuecomment-1422824328",
